BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Manas Itene: Community Drum Circle and Acoustic Concert
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T170000
UID:260528jGAVJcQo_06wOu0AN-VIOQ
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy an afternoon of live music\, rhythm\, and community conn
 ection with singer and drummer Manas Itene on Sunday\, June 7\, from 2:00 
 to 5:00 PM at the Santa Rosa Veterans Building\, North Room\, located at 1
 351 Maple Ave\, Santa Rosa.\n\nThe event will begin with an intimate acous
 tic set by Manas. He brings songs from his new album Give Thanks. Songs ab
 out unity\, love\, connection and community. The concert will flow into a 
 full community drum circle where all ages and experience levels are welcom
 e. Guests are invited to bring a drum if they have one\, but no instrument
  is required — hands\, voices\, and good energy are more than enough.\n\
 nManas brings over three decades of experience as a professional musician 
 and drummer\, creating spaces where music becomes more than performance: i
 t becomes connection. This afternoon is designed for people of all ages to
  gather\, listen\, participate\, and remember the joy of being in rhythm t
 ogether.\n\nwww.manasitene.com\n\nThe event is hosted by Jessica Tunis.\n\
 nTickets are $35 in advance and $40 at the door.
LOCATION:Santa Rosa Veterans Building- North Room
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/manas-itene-community-d
 rum-circle-and-acoustic-concert/19010852/2026-06-07T14
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
