 ds\, Guerneville. You do not need to own a chainsaw to attend! This is a d
 emonstration. To RSVP and for more information visit: https://stewardscr.o
 rg/events/victoria\\_wagner\\_june-7-2026/\n\nVictoria will lead a demonst
 ration on getting to know your chainsaw and share safety basics to keep in
  mind when using your own chainsaw.\n\nShe will also demonstrate how she a
 pproaches a large scale sculpture on reclaimed wood from the park.\n\nPlea
 se bring your sketchbook in the event that your imagination is sparked dur
 ing your time together.
LOCATION:Stewards of the Coast and Redwoods Volunteer Building
