 vineyards at Paradise Ridge Winery. Enjoy our Sunday Live Music Sessions t
 he 1st & 3rd Sundays of each month. Listen to popular tunes and acoustic m
 usic all while taking in the warm summer weather and vineyard ambience. We
  offer a variety of artisan cheeses\, cured meats\, olives\, hand pies and
  other light fare. A wonderful way to spend a Sunday afternoon in Paradise
 ! Sunday June 7th live tunes by Skyhawk.
