BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Concert
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T173000
UID:260515eYfXwlc6hEqZlWBvlBAAgg
DESCRIPTION:Come join Cantiamo Sonoma for a Summer Concert at St. Seraphim
  Cathedral on Sunday afternoon\, June 7th at 4:00 p.m. \n\nWe’ll perfor
 m an eclectic array of a cappella music from Renaissance to contemporary c
 omposers including the works of C. V. Stanford\, Rolande Lassus\, G.P. da 
 Palestrina\, Edward Bairstow\, Rene Clausen\, Gerald Finzi\, Moses Hogan\,
  Christopher Tin\, Don MacDonald\, Michael John Trotta\, and more!\n\nThe 
 cathedral is located at 90 Mountain View Avenue in Santa Rosa. Hear the go
 rgeous acoustics of the cathedral surrounded by its magnificent iconograph
 y!\n\nTickets are $30 and will be sold at the door. There will be an al fr
 esco reception immediately following the concert. \n\nWe’d love to sere
 nade you!
LOCATION:Saint Seraphim Of Sarov Othodox Cathedral
URL:http://www.cantiamosonoma.org
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
