DESCRIPTION:Polly O’Keary and The Rhythm Method are a high‑energy\, aw
 ard‑winning blues‑rock trio from Seattle\, known for their powerhouse 
 musicianship\, big personalities\, and wildly entertaining live shows. Whe
 n not touring nationally\, they light up festivals and venues across the N
 orthwest with a fiery mix of Blues\, Rock ’n’ Roll\, R&B\, Soul\, and 
 more. The band has earned national acclaim—including charting releases a
 nd recognition from the International Blues Challenge and LA Music Critic
 —and its members hold multiple Washington Blues Society awards for vocal
 s\, songwriting\, bass\, drums\, and guitar. Full bio\, press kit\, media\
 , and radio coverage are available on the band’s website. www.pollyokear
 y.com
LOCATION:The Big Easy
