DESCRIPTION:Vintage Rock Night - Napa. Everybody’s favorite tunes from t
 he 60’s \, 70’s and 80’s.\n\nOn June 7\, at the Napa Yard in Napa\, 
 the folks from Not Loud Concerts present Summer Sessions - Vintage Rock Ni
 ght! This festival is part of the Not Loud Concert Summer Series - a set o
 f concerts designed to be Not too long\, Not too expensive\, and of course
 \, Not too loud.\n\nDesigned with the audience's comfort in mind\, this sh
 ort festival will be held in the beautiful outdoor space at Napa Yard. The
 re will be 2 vintage rock bands on stage at the same time dueling it out a
 nd trading songs.\n\nThis concert will feature the high-energy rock band\,
  Dirty Cello who are known for their crazy and electrifying performances o
 f everything from the the Stones to CCR. They'll be paired with The Rockbu
 sters\, a roaring nostalgia-filled cover band playing all of your favorite
  songs from the '80s.\n\nBring a chair or sit in one of the ones provided 
 or get up and dance under the stars\, to all your favorite songs at Vintag
 e Rock Night. Nearby Napa Yard will be offering beer\, craft cocktails\, a
 nd BBQ.\n\nAll the Not Loud Concerts focus on the best of what live music 
 is about - casual fun without the crowds\, lines\, and porta-potties of mo
 st summer shows. Clean bathrooms!\n\nNot Loud Concerts will be presenting 
 a whole series of summer shows including\n\nGilman Jazz Festival - Berkele
 y - May 3\n\nVintage Rock Night - Napa - June 7\n\nBlues Night - Napa - Ju
 ly 19\n\nBluses Night - Berkeley\, July 26\n\nCountry Boogie Night - Napa 
 - Aug 16\n\nCountry Boogie Night - Berkeley - Aug 23\n\nVintage Rock Night
  - Berkeley - Sept 20\n\nNotLoudConcerts.com
LOCATION:Napa Yard Oxbow
