DESCRIPTION:ATTENTION…we are under the watchful eye of the Vintage Oaks 
 Shopping Center! BEHAVE!\n\n1. The first Sunday of every month\, rain or s
 hine\, in front of Starbuck’s in the Vintage Oaks Shopping Center Novato
 \, California.\n\n2. 6:30 am in the morning to 10:00am. Arrive when you wa
 nt.\n\n3. Check your ego at the stop sign.\n\n4. Park where you can.\n\n5.
  It’s free! Excluding your Starbuck’s purchases! Please do patronize t
 he local stores!\n\n6. Leave when you want. BUT\, behave yourself! No burn
 outs\, no running over pedestrians\, no sudden left turns into center divi
 ders. Seriously\, you won’t impress anyone and the other 300\\+ cars own
 ers will not take kindly to any attempt you might make to screw up this ev
 ent.\n\n7. Photographs will be taken of your car.Many of these photographs
  \\(including personalized license plates\\) will find their way to the we
 b.\n\n8. The Marin Cars and Coffee Facebook page posts pictures\, monthly\
 , that participants may continue to revel in the experience and to allow o
 thers\, who missed attending\, to fill this void in their lives.\n\n9. Thi
 s is a family friendly get-together.\n\n10. There is a welcomed police pre
 sence \\(hint\, hint\\).\n\n11. Enjoy yourself! This is a wonderful assemb
 ly of diverse car owning folks! Lots to see and lots to learn!
