UID:260522SXCqjKrtjUOiO6ZDV6OGPw
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to repair clothing with woven darning—a functional
  and beautiful technique especially suited for knitwear. This workshop cov
 ers material selection\, setting up a darn\, and weaving strong\, expressi
 ve patches.\n\n**In this workshop you’ll:**\n\n• Choose yarns and mate
 rials for woven darning\n\n• Set up and weave a stable darn\n\n• Explo
 re design choices for creative\, visible repairs\n\nBring a garment to men
 d\, or use provided samples. Materials included\; no experience required.
