DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260609T183000
UID:260517Y9VF1m0bLkuuboh5wkf8-Q
DESCRIPTION:Pottery design with artist Serenity Joy on our Novato Patio!\n
 \n Join Serenity Joy for a beginner-friendly ceramics workshop where you
 ’ll learn hand building techniques and explore surface design using carv
 ing\, stamping\, and sgraffito.  \n\n Serenity is the owner of Centered
  pottery studio and head design manager at Williams Sonoma\, and has an in
 nate love for making everyday objects beautiful and joyful. Come connect a
 nd play\, no experience needed.\n\n What You'll Learn:\n\nThe basics of cr
 eating with clay\, including a variety of decorating techniques\n\n Why Jo
 in Us?\n\nAll materials provided – just bring your creativity!\n\nPerfec
 t for gifting\, home decor\, or just a fun creative outing\n\nNo experienc
 e necessary – we'll walk you through each step!\n\n Class Details:\n\nDu
 ration: 1.5 hours\n\nLocation: The patio at Made Local Marketplace\, 881 G
 rant Ave\, Novato\n\nCost: $50 per person \\(16\\+ individually\, 6\\+ wit
 h an adult\\)\n\nAdvanced registration required. Spaces are limited\, so d
 on’t wait!
LOCATION:Made Local Marketplace
URL:https://www.madelocalmarketplace.com/workshops
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
