 , and exciting scientific discoveries with Instructor Phil Amormino! This
  camp will introduce campers to the fascinating world of science\, from ch
 emistry experiments to physics challenges. Campers will learn scientific p
 rinciples in a fun\, interactive way and develop critical thinking skills 
 while engaging in hands-on experiments that bring science to life.
LOCATION:Hanna Center
