BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Brian Culbertson's Napa Valley Jazz Getaway 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260610T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260610T000000
UID:26022479H_kX95okKEWdkug81u_Q
DESCRIPTION:Andréa Lisa\, the South African-born and New Zealand-raised a
 rtist\, is a musical powerhouse driven by personal experiences and her dee
 p-rooted inspirations. As a singer\, guitarist\, songwriter\, composer\, a
 nd producer\, Andréa's diverse talents shine through in every aspect of h
 er music.\n\n \n\nHer journey in music began at a young age\, with soul\, 
 jazz\, and R&B sounds infusing her daily life. At 15\, she started craftin
 g her own music and lyrics\, setting her on a path of artistic exploration
 . A graduate of the New Zealand School of Music with a major in jazz guita
 r and vocals\, Andréa's passion for composition led her to create a rich 
 assembly of genres that blend into a unique and captivating artistic alche
 my.\n\nAndréa Lisa's music aims to uplift\, help\, and heal others\, refl
 ecting her main desire to make a positive impact through her art. Her rece
 nt single "Like Each Other" perfectly encapsulates this vision\, drawing i
 nspiration from her South African roots\, where dance and rhythm are deepl
 y ingrained in the culture. Throughout her career\, Andréa has achieved s
 ignificant milestones\, including being featured on Grammy award-winning a
 rtist Kirk Whalum's album "Humanité" and joining the esteemed D’Angelic
 o guitar family as a brand ambassador.\n\n \n\nIn 2023\, Andréa continued
  to soar with the release of three new singles: "Vortex\," "Golden Hour\,"
  and "Like Each Other." Her music has been widely recognized\, with "Vorte
 x" making its mark on Billboard radio\, SiriusXM Watercolors\, iHeart Radi
 o and gaining success on multiple charts.\n\n \n\nAs a multifaceted talent
 \, Andréa Lisa has collaborated with renowned artists like Jonathan Butle
 r\, Ralph Johnson \\(Earth Wind & Fire\\)\, and George Brown \\(Kool & the
  Gang\\). Her guitar work on Kool & the Gang's latest album further solidi
 fies her status as an exceptional musician.\n\n \n\nWith her powerful voca
 ls\, soulful melodies\, and heartfelt lyrics\, Andréa Lisa's music is a t
 estament to her unwavering commitment to creating art that touches hearts 
 and souls. As she continues to mesmerize audiences worldwide\, her musical
  journey is poised for even greater heights in the years to come.\n\nAndr
 éa's debut album "Silver Lining" is now available on all streaming platfo
 rms\, along with physical copies available from andrealisastore.com.
LOCATION:The Meritage Resort and Spa
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107726733?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
