 ended Classes\n\nAge(s)\n\n18 and older\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$250\n\nM
 aterials Fee:\n\nIncluded\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n**$250**\n\nJoin 
 our 6-week acrylic painting course for beginners. Covers color mixing\, br
 ush techniques\, and composition across landscape and abstract styles.\n\n
 About the Class\n\nThis six-week acrylic painting course is designed for b
