 sh closure\, today's book group will be meeting at Round Table Pizza\, 550
  Montecito Center\, Santa Rosa\, \\(next to Oliver's.\\) Book Club titles 
 and dates are subject to change. For up to date information visit: sonomal
 ibrary.org/bookclubs 2026 Book Club Schedule: January 14 - James Percival 
 by Everett February 11 - Feeding Ghosts by Tessa Hulls March 11 - Martyr! 
 by Kaveh Akbar April 8 - Haben: The Deafblind Woman Who Conquered Harvard 
 Law by Haben Girma May 13 - Under the Whispering Door by TJ Klune June 10 
 - The Wide Wide Sea by Hampton Sides July 8 - The Berry Pickers by Amanda 
 Peters August 12 - The Man who could move Clouds by Ingrid Rojas Contreras
  September 9 - How to Solve your own Murder by Kristen Perrin October 14 -
  The Return: Fathers\, Sons\, and the Land by Hishan Matar November 18\\* 
 - The Safekeep by Yael Van Dear Wouden December 9 - Social gathering! Shar
 e your favorite books from the year.
LOCATION:Rincon Valley Regional Library
