DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260611T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260611T150000
UID:260603M-Ax0V4Xd0OLYgNgh-Bpow
DESCRIPTION:**Whimsical Animals in Acrylic!**\n\n**100% beginner-friendly*
 *\n\nIn these fun & expressive acrylic painting sessions\, each week we'll
  paint animals. These guys will have charm\, charisma\, & character to spa
 re!\n\nThe goal is to let loose\, enjoy the process of painting & expressi
 ng yourself.\n\n**What you'll learn:**\n\n💜 How to transfer or sketch a
  reference picture onto your canvas.\n\n💜 How to mix\, blend\, and buil
 d layers with acrylic paint.\n\n💜 Most importantly\, practice letting g
 o! Learning how to play\, explore\, and have fun making art!\n\nJune 04 - 
 Elephants\n\nJune 11 - Dogs\n\nJune 18 - Sheep\n\nJune 25 - Tigers\n\nThur
 sdays\, 1-3 PM\, $45 per class.\n\n**Bring a friend & both get $10 off!**
