DESCRIPTION:This three-piece band plays jazz like you’ve never heard bef
 ore. Burjor Dastur on guitar\, Mike Varga on bass\, and Joey Waterman on d
 rums play compositions by Wayne Shorter\, Kenny Burrell\, Chick Corea\, We
 s Montgomery\, Joe Henderson\, Sonny Rollins\, and Charles Mingus. Don’t
