BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:4th Annual Phoenix Pride Benefit Showcase
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260611T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260611T220000
UID:260530wy7Svu8zGEiFTpk7wqsBYQ
DESCRIPTION:Retro Pride. Live art. Big love. Dance all night. Support LGBT
 QIA\\+ community magic.  ✨ Phoenix Pride Benefit Showcase – 4th Annual
  Retro Celebration  ✨ Phoenix Dance Team proudly presents our 4th Annual
  Pride Benefit Showcase—a night of performance\, community\, and retro-i
 nspired celebration honoring both the past and present of LGBTQIA\\+ artis
 try. This year’s showcase leans into a retro theme\, paying tribute to t
 he eras when queer expression found its voice through music\, dance floors
 \, and underground performance spaces. Enjoy a spectrum of performers incl
 uding burlesque\, drag\, vocalists\, and dance\, along with representative
 s from each organization sharing insights on the meaningful work that they
  do. Proceeds from ticket sales will benefit:  Positive Images  Amor Para 
 Todos  VIDAS Pro tip: Bring some cash! We’ll be embracing a lively tippi
 ng culture throughout the night—so you can shower extra love on our perf
 ormers and support the magic happening onstage. Think of it as honoring th
 e tradition of community-supported performance that has long been part of 
 queer nightlife and culture. And the night doesn’t end when the curtain 
 falls… Stay for our annual post-show retro dance party! After the showca
 se\, the venue transforms into a dance floor where we come together to cel
 ebrate\, connect\, and keep the Pride spirit alive Come for the show. Stay
  for the party. Leave with a full heart and a little disco sparkle. Join u
 s for a night of art\, advocacy\, and Pride—retro style. Tickets $20 in 
 advance\, $25 at the door. Doors open 6:30pm
LOCATION:528 7th St
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1973941813329605/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
