 a one-of-a-kind experience. Hosted by the improvisational hip hop duo Dark
  Matter Lives! The debut episode takes place at The Lost Church on Thursda
 y\, June 11\, 2026\, featuring our first round of contestants: Kayatta \\(
 @kayattamusic\\)\, Mr. BMMNM!!! \\(@illlbmmnminati\\)\, The Maine Man \\(@
