 ill levels welcome. Bring your own drawing or watercolor materials. This i
 s not an instructional class. Founded more than thirty years ago by Bill W
 heeler\, this group continues in his honor and is coordinated by a dedicat
 ed group of local artists led by John James. $20 per person for OCA member
 s\, $25 for non-members. Payment accepted at the door\, cash or check only
 . No minimum requirement of participation. Please get in touch with the co
 ordinator before attending to ensure that there is space. \\#figuredrawing
