DESCRIPTION:Petaluma Library Book Club 2nd Thursday of the Month\, 12:00 p
 m Print Copies will be available in the branch a month before the discussi
 on. Please call or email the Library with any questions. Book Club titles 
 and dates are subject to change. For up to date information visit: sonomal
 ibrary.org/bookclubs 2026 Book Club Schedule: January 8 - Anita de Monte L
 aughs Last by Xochitl Gonzalez February 12 - Haben: The Deafblind Woman Wh
 o Conquered Harvard Law by Haben Girma March 12 - The Safekeep by Yael Van
  Dear Wouden April 9 - North Woods by Daniel Mason May 14 - Martyr! by Kav
 eh Akbar June 11 - The Husbands by Holly Gramazio July 9 - The Fox Wife by
  Yangsze Choo August 13 - Beautyland by Marie-Helene Bertino September 10 
 - The Heaven & Earth Grocery Store by James McBride October 15 - Eager by 
 Ben Goldfarb November 12 - Family Lore by Elizabeth Acevedo December 10 - 
