DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260612T213000
UID:2606027IjgHhwvyk6P84rdSppFMQ
DESCRIPTION:Escape into an unforgettable evening of live music\, burlesque
 \, and cabaret beneath the redwoods.\n\nFeather & Flow invites you to the 
 historic Rio Nido Lodge for a one-of-a-kind night of soulful music\, capti
 vating burlesque\, craft cocktails\, and intimate nightlife in the heart o
 f the Russian River. Set against the rustic charm of Rio Nido Lodge\, this
  immersive experience blends live music and burlesque artistry into an eve
 ning that is equal parts glamorous\, playful\, and unforgettable. Whether 
 you're planning a romantic date night\, a girls' night out\, or simply loo
 king for a unique Sonoma County experience\, Feather & Flow offers a magic
 al evening unlike anything else in the area.\n\nThe night features award-w
 inning cabaret chanteuse Coco Lamarr performing soulful favorites inspired
  by the music of Amy Winehouse\, accompanied by LBZ\, a dynamic live music
 ian known for his energetic performances and original music. Between music
 al sets\, enjoy captivating burlesque performances from Thotty McNaughty\,
  Rebel Rose\, Alotta Boutte\, Montana Skye\, Kim\, and Andy Rose.\n\nUpgra
 de your evening with a reserved VIP table for four guests\, complete with 
 a bottle of bubbly and a curated charcuterie board for the ultimate night 
 out.Join us Friday\, June 12 at Rio Nido Lodge and experience an enchantin
 g evening of music\, glamour\, and entertainment beneath the redwoods.\n\n
 Doors: 7:00 PM Show: 7:30 PM\n\nRio Nido Lodge\, 4444 Wood Road\, Guernevi
 lle\, CA 95446
LOCATION:The Rio Nido Lodge
URL:https://events.ticketleap.com/tickets/thotty-mcnaughty-productions/fea
 ther-flow-guerneville-ca
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
