DESCRIPTION:Just a short drive from San Francisco\, Anderson Valley is cel
 ebrated as one of the world’s most beautiful regions and a true haven fo
 r Pinot Noir. This signature festival brings together more than 50 winerie
 s\, including prestigious Napa and Sonoma labels\, for the only tasting ev
 ent set among the vineyards themselves.    The weekend features immersive 
 experiences for every wine lover\, from a Friday vineyard seminar and suns
 et BBQ focused on sustainable farming\, to the Saturday Grand Tasting show
 casing Pinot Noir\, Sparkling\, Rosé\, and White Pinot. Guests can also e
 njoy gourmet food pairings\, a silent auction\, winemaker-led tours and ta
 stings\, and Sunday VIP winery open houses for continued exploration. Tick
 ets are limited\, so reserve early and plan lodging in advance.
LOCATION:Wine Road Hwy 128 \, Anderson Valley
URL:https://www.winecountry.com/event/27th-annual-anderson-valley-pinot-no
 ir-festival/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
