DESCRIPTION:Spirit Rock invites you to experience our annual Sacred Sounds
  concert series! Each session will feature a musical artist devoted to cre
 ating\, honoring\, and sharing sacred spiritual music in many exciting for
 ms. Join us for a nourishing and uplifting combination of transformative m
 usic in our Great Hall\, an optional bring-your-own picnic outside in natu
 re\, and an opportunity to gather with saṅgha on our stunning Spirit Roc
 k land. Gates will open two hours before the performance.\n\nCome gather f
 or this deeply inspiring experience with Ayla Nereo\, as we remember the s
 pace between sound\, the ripples of possibility\, and all that we are beco
 ming.\n\nThis is a special and intimate offering with Ayla that will trave
 rse her acoustic and vocal songs into dance and movement. Expect vocal-loo
 p-layered mantras\, acoustic and acapella moments\, and a communal space t
 o offer sound as a gift for all of Life.\n\nFor these times of great chang
 e\, we come together to sing alive our kinship\, our reclamation of the po
 wer of imagination\, the remembrance of all we will Be and create together
 . Join Ayla is sending our voices forth\, as waves into the field of remem
 brance for all we can Be.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/sacred-sounds-sessions
 -ethereal-song-embodied-rhythm-with-ayla-nereo-ay1e26-2/?lang=en
