UID:260416665XQ8UPqE-D_MtLjo-2YQ
DESCRIPTION:Soul Brass Band is the brainchild of drummer\, emcee\, and New
  Orleans cultural force Derrick “Smoker” Freeman\, blending second lin
 e tradition with hip hop grit\, deep funk\, and streetwise soul. Their per
 formances flip every stage into a block party—blurring the line between 
 concert and carnival.\n\nSoul Brass Band delivers a fresh interpretation o
 f the brass band canon—infusing deep street rhythms with jazz stylings\,
  soul sounds\, and Freeman’s magnetic stage presence.\n\nWhether leading
  a second line parade\, igniting a hotel rooftop\, or headlining a cultura
 l showcase\, Soul Brass Band brings the heartbeat of New Orleans to every 
 event.
