BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Callie Watts
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260612T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260612T000000
UID:260327BhOXe3AEpESXJ0mwb46XsQ
DESCRIPTION:Callie Watts is a singer/songwriter from Northern California w
 ho was raised on classical music\, The Beatles and The Beach Boys before d
 iscovering Joni Mitchell\, Elton John\, Stevie Wonder\, Paul Simon\, Billy
  Joel\, Carole King\, and all the great writers of the ’60s and 70’s w
 ho have influenced her sound and writing style. After graduating high scho
 ol\, Callie began playing and performing solo\, as well as in local and ba
 y area bands of different genres. She’s played blues with Eric Lindell a
 nd the Reds\, funky soul with Phatty\, and jazz/swing with Savoy Swingers 
 along with many other various projects. Callie has taken turns throughout 
 her career as a keyboardist\, guitarist\, writer\, and lead/backing vocali
 st\, and she’s currently a member of the dynamic Sonoma County funk rock
  band Burrows and Dilbeck\, having joined in 2010 as part of the former ba
 nd Frobeck. Over time\, she’s had the honor of opening for acts such as 
 Bootsy Collins\, Elvin Bishop\, Huey Lewis and The News\, War\, Ozomatli\,
  Bill Champlin\, Booker T\, and the B52s. Callie continues to perform freq
 uently as an acoustic solo artist\, focusing on developing a core audience
  and a buzz for her original material. Come hang out and listen at venues 
 such as Aroma Roasters\, Rincon Valley Tap Room and Bottle Shop\, and Hopm
 onk Tavern.
LOCATION:Rodney Strong Vineyards
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107988606?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nancy Fawson Music
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260612T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260612T000000
UID:260307Mgju6rLxuUWdAH0lDmgKCQ
DESCRIPTION:Nancy Fawson is a powerhouse Bay Area-based vocalist and songw
 riter whose musical roots run deep in soul\, R&B and rock. Raised on the i
 conic sounds of Sam Cooke\, Etta James\, Aretha Franklin\, Chaka Khan\, St
 evie Wonder\, and Amy Winehouse\, Nancy’s musical influences have left a
 n indelible imprint on her voice and style. With a unique\, soulful tone a
 nd a passion for heartfelt expression\, Nancy connects with her audience o
 n a profound level—delivering each song with purity\, emotion\, and auth
 enticity.\n\nNancy’s vocal range spans across a variety of genres\, incl
 uding soul\, funk\, blues\, R&B\, and rock\, allowing her to bring versati
 lity to every performance. Whether performing with a duo or full band\, sh
 e engages audiences with her compelling stage presence and soulful deliver
 y.\n\nAs the lead singer of the popular Marin-based blues\, soul\, and fun
 k band Corner Pocket\, Nancy continues to captivate crowds with her raw en
 ergy and dedication to the craft. In addition to live performances\, she i
 s also available for recording session work\, offering her talents as both
  a lead and background vocalist.\n\nWith a sound that blends classic influ
 ences with modern flair\, Nancy Fawson is an artist whose voice you won’
 t soon forget.
LOCATION:Rio Nido Roadhouse
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107881729?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
