BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pepper on the Run - Beatles & Wings Tribute - Live Music in Downto
 wn SR
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T230000
UID:260605s8Lwd8nABUuIYd6zfS8tAA
DESCRIPTION:Beatles & Wings tribute Pepper On The Run brings the hits\, ha
 rmonies\, and nostalgia to Downtown Santa Rosa.\n\nFrom the first chord of
  "I Saw Her Standing There" to the arena-sized anthems of Wings\, Pepper O
 n The Run delivers an evening packed with some of the most beloved songs e
 ver written.\n\nThis isn't a wig-and-costume tribute act. Pepper On The Ru
 n focuses on what matters most: the music.\n\nFeaturing period-correct ins
 truments\, authentic arrangements\, and a high-energy live show\, the band
  recreates the sound and spirit of The Beatles and Wings while keeping the
  performance fresh\, exciting\, and danceable. Fans have even described th
 em as "Beatles with balls!"\n\nExpect classics from every era\, including 
 favorites from Paul McCartney's Beatles years and the Wings catalog\, alon
 gside many of the songs that defined a generation. Whether you grew up wit
 h these records or discovered them later\, you'll know the words\, you'll 
 sing along\, and you might find yourself dancing like it's 1969.\n\nThe cu
 rrent lineup features Tony Lemieux (vocals\, guitar)\, Ian Luke (drums)\, 
 Stu Dahlquist (guitar\, vocals)\, Gary Schlosberg (keyboards\, vocals)\, a
 nd Chuck Stone (bass).\n\nGather your friends\, grab a drink\, and take a 
 magical mystery tour through one of the greatest songbooks in rock history
 .\n\nSaturday\, June 13 Doors 7:00 PM | Show 8:00 PM Barrel Proof Lounge 5
 01 Mendocino Avenue\, Downtown Santa Rosa Tickets: $10 Advance $15 Door 21
 + Check out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahea
 d!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/pepper-on-the-run-beatles-wings-tribute-l
 ive-music-in-downtown-sr-tickets-1991005252306?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Transformative Paper: Sculptural Forms with High-Shrinkage Pulp
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T160000
UID:260605qdIkdAqAxkO1bNNYdRlEUQ
DESCRIPTION:Schedule\n\nSaturday\, June 13 – Sunday\, June 14\, 2026 10:
 00 AM – 4:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 208\n\nExperience Level\n\nAll Level
 s\n\nEvent Categories: Fiber Arts\, Printmaking\n\nAge(s)\n\n18 and older\
 n\n**$205** – Registration Cost **$45** – Materials Fee **$250** – T
 otal Registration Cost\n\nFor any student interested in using handmade pap
 er to create sculptural forms with armatures\, this is a class for you!\n\
 nAbout the Class\n\nFor any student interested in using handmade paper to 
 create sculptural forms with armatures\, this is a class for you! Students
  will learn building methods for armatures and ways to wrap and dip their 
 armatures in handmade paper prepared in a way that is called “high shrin
 kage.” In this method\, paper pulp has been beaten for a long period of 
 time to absorb a large amount of water\, and dramatic transformations can 
 occur when the form dries. All supplies are provided through the materials
  fee. La maestra habla español. Papermaking is a wet process\, please wea
 r clothing and shoes that can get wet. Papermaking also involves some lift
 ing and arm movements. Note: There will be a one-hour lunch break each day
 . Please bring a bag lunch.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/transformative-paper-sculpt
 ural-forms-with-high-shrinkage-pulp/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
