DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T220000
UID:260604SjTWnov16Emjo4Vir4F9iQ
DESCRIPTION:A Disco Diva\, a Choir in Crisis\, and a Whole Lot of Soul!\n\
 n“One of the season’s happiest surprises.” —Elisabeth Vincentelli 
 for New York Post\n\nSister Act is the high-energy musical comedy based on
  the beloved 1992 film. Featuring an electrifying Alan Menken score infuse
 d with disco and gospel beats\, this feel-good show is a celebration of mu
 sic\, sisterhood\, and second chances.\n\nWhen disco diva Deloris Van Cart
 ier witnesses a crime\, she’s forced into hiding—in a convent! Disguis
 ed as a nun\, she transforms the struggling choir with her powerhouse voic
 e\, helping them find their sound while discovering her own. Nominated for
  five Tony Awards\, Sister Act is a joyful\, soul-stirring spectacle that 
 proves music—and a little mischief—can work miracles!\n\nThursdays\, F
 ridays & Saturdays @ 7:30pm\, Saturdays and Sundays at 2:00pm Run Time: Tw
 o hours\, 30 mins including intermission\n\nThursdays Adult $33Fri/Sat Eve
  Adult $44.95\; Senior $38.95\; Under 18 $31.95Sat/Sun Matinee Adult $55.9
 5\; Senior $48.95Value seating $37.95\\*All prices include fees\n\n\\(707\
 \) 523-4185\n\nboxoffice@6thstreetplayhouse.com
LOCATION:6th Street Playhouse
