SUMMARY:North Coast Food & Wine Festival at Luther Burbank
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T130000
UID:260516UmI7Yak2g0C0b1--XclLHw
DESCRIPTION:North Coast Wine & Food Festival brings together the best of W
 ine Country for an afternoon of exceptional food\, award-winning wines\, a
 nd live entertainment at the Luther Burbank Center for the Arts. Guests ca
 n sample more than 100 gold and double gold medal-winning wines from acros
 s the North Coast alongside bites from over 20 acclaimed chefs showcasing 
 the region's rich culinary diversity. With live music\, local flavors\, an
 d opportunities to meet winemakers and chefs\, the festival offers a livel
 y celebration of Sonoma\, Napa\, Mendocino\, and neighboring wine regions.
  This premier 21\\+ event highlights the craftsmanship\, culture\, and com
 munity that define Northern California wine country.
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/north-coast-food-wine-festival-at-luther-
 burbank-center/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
