BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Roustabout Theater's Professional Ensemble Presents The Homecoming
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T193000
UID:260528lSoHaJkOVkiZ7lOdPPSoIQ
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\nRoustabout Theater’s Professional Ensem
 ble Presents\n\nThe Homecoming\n\nSaturday\, June 13\, 7:30pm\n\nSunday\,
  June 14\, 2:00pm\n\nSaturday\, June 20\, 7:30pm\n\nSunday\, June 21\, 2:0
 0pm\n\nFriday\, June 26\, 7:30pm\n\nSaturday\, June 27\, 7:30pm\n\nSunday\
 , June 28\, 2:00pm\n\nBuy Tickets for June 13 at 7:30 pm\n\nBuy Tickets fo
 r June 14 at 2:00 pm\n\nBuy Tickets for June 20 at 7:30 pm\n\nBuy Tickets 
 for June 21 at 2:00 pm\n\nBuy Tickets for June 26 at 7:30 pm\n\nBuy Ticket
 s for June 27 at 7:30 pm\n\nBuy Tickets for June 28 at 2:00 pm \n\nRoustab
 out Theater’s Intimate Revival of Harold Pinter’s The Homecoming Explo
 res Family\, Power and Desire \n\nA searing masterpiece of modern theater\
 , The Homecoming returns to the stage in a riveting new production that fe
 atures beloved North Bay actors in this provocative drama by Nobel Prize
 –winning playwright Harold Pinter. \n\nSet in 1960’s North London\, Th
 e Homecoming explores how an unexpected family reunion spirals into a tens
 e and witty psychological battle\, as shifting alliances and unspoken desi
 res transform the household. Through razor-sharp dialogue and unexpected h
 umor\, Pinter draws audiences into a world where every pause speaks volume
 s. \n\nCelebrated for its daring themes and uncompromising vision\, The Ho
 mecoming won the Tony Award for Best Play and remains one of the defining 
 works of twentieth-century drama. Roustabout’s dynamic Ensemble promises
  a memorable theatrical event as it questions the roles we perform within 
 our own families. \n\nPerformances are June 13 – 28 at The Luther Burban
 k Center for the Arts where Roustabout Theater is Resident Theater Company
 . \n\nRoustabout Theater is the longest running Resident Theater at the LB
 C offering both our Professional Ensemble performances utilizing professio
 nal talent from across the Bay Area and our award-winning Apprentice Progr
 am\, a leading training program for actors and stage managers ages 11 – 
 20. \n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\n\nDon’t get taken by deceptive onlin
 e resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The
  only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at th
 e lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\
 , or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendl
 y team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to prov
 ide customer support.
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/roustabout-the-homecoming/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
