BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Comedy Night - Steve Bruner and Jim Farrell
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T213000
UID:2605275BymnKr9xkakT3NFPqiuGQ
DESCRIPTION:Comedy Night at Konocti Vista Casino and Resort Venue: Konocti
  Vista Casino and Resort Address: 2755 Mission Rancheria Rd.\, Lakeport\, 
 CA Bar & Doors Open: 7:00 pm\, Saturday\, June 13th\, 2026 Showtime: 8:00 
 pm to 9:30 pm Ticket Price: $20 fees apply \\(Includes a $10 matchplay wit
 h purchase\\) Purchase at the Player's Club or Online: https://www.etix.co
 m/ticket/p/92235753/comedy-night-steve-bruner-and-jim-farrell-lakeport-kon
 octi-vista-event-center  Headliner: Steve Bruner Like your comedy rare? St
 eve Bruner serves it up! Not just hysterically funny --also clean and insi
 ghtful-- Steve has been satisfying the big appetite for his brand of humor
  in television and comedy club appearances across the county. Steve has be
 en featured on such shows as Showtime's Comedy Club Network\, An Evening a
 t the Improv\, Into the Night\, and The Byron Allen Show. Club appearances
  include The Hermosa Beach Comedy & Magic Club\, Catch a Rising Star\, The
  Punchline\, and The Ice House. Steve has also starred in a classically fu
 nny Cerritos Auto Square commercial\, and been featured in a promo for a C
 osby and Nash project and Children's Charities PSA. Film roles include Stu
 art in Banana Moon\, Andy in The Acting Lesson\, and Richard in The Necess
 ary World of Make Believe. He has also appeared in numerous theatre produc
 tions. His brilliant comedic sensibility has landed him work as a writer f
 or several TV shows including joke writing for the Tonight Show with Jay L
 eno. Steve sings \\(tenor\\)\, dances \\(ball room\\)\, and juggles. Sport
 s include tennis\, ping pong\, running\, swimming\, sailing and soccer. Fi
 nally\, George Carlin's Laugh.com ever so aptly says. "Steve is a great gu
 y. He is also one of the most successful comedians in the business. You ca
 n see him regularly in clubs\, on television and on cruise ships. Clean\, 
 smart and funny define Steve." Opener: Jim Farrell Jim is a Sacramento bas
 ed Stand Up Comic\, Story Teller\, and Comedy Writer who has spent time in
  Los Angeles and San Francisco. After getting his start in his home town\,
  he moved to Los Angeles where he soon got a series of writing job that in
 clude Comic Strip Live\, Sunday Comic\, The Byron Allen show and\, was a c
 ontributing writer on the Tonight Show with Jay Leno. After several years 
 LA living\, Jim moved to San Francisco to concentrate on Stand-Up Comedy\,
  with a side gig in wine. He soon became a regular at The Punchline and Co
 bb’s Comedy Club.  Jim performed throughout the West Coast\, frequently 
 at Laughs Unlimited\, Holy City Zoo\, Tommy T’s\, Rooster T Feathers and
  Fubar’s Comedy club\, as well as Laughs Comedy Night Club in Tucson and
  Albuquerque. After taking some time away\, Jim is back and funnier than e
 ver with his cynical and uncomfortably honest comedy. Location: The show w
 ill be held in the exquisite Banquet Hall. Make sure to get there early fo
 r the best seats. Bar Service: Quench your thirst before the show starts! 
 Doors and the bar open at 7 pm. Age Restriction: Attendees must be 21 or o
 lder. Seating: Limited availability to ensure an intimate comedy experienc
 e. Secure your spot now by purchasing tickets online or at the Player’s 
 Club. Grab your tickets and prepare for an evening filled with laughter an
 d top-notch entertainment
LOCATION:Konocti Vista Casino Resort
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1355771786366822/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
