BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TAKE YOUR TIME: Oil Pintings by Sharon Eisley
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T170000
UID:2605293ncPpElZBEqbWbyKBu28_Q
DESCRIPTION:“Take Your Time”\n\nChange and transformation take time. I
 n her newest oil paintings Sharon Eisley explores the time as a process. B
 e it moving through grief\, re-framing your story of self\, or birthing so
 me new creation\, each painting lures you in with beautiful application th
 en holds you in time for a closer examination of our human experience. Eis
 ley's paintings are all inspired by tarot cards and her personal journey. 
 Tarot readings will be offered at the reception by @SymbolWarehouse for an
  optional small donation.\n\nOur guest artist\, Robert Benson\, will be ch
 allenging your eyes to fill in the details with his impressionist watercol
 ors.\n\nThis June 20th reception will be the FINAL art opening for Sebasto
 pol Gallery in its home of almost 20 years! This show may last only throug
 h June 2026\, then move to our new location. Or it may be up through June 
 and July. Either way\, this will be your last chance to come celebrate our
  local\, amazing group of artists at 150 N Main St.. “Take Your Time” 
 is a reminder to our collective to take our time finding and setting up ou
 r new home for all of you. I hope you can all come celebrate all the time 
 and art we shared with you in our lovely gallery.\n\nwww.sharoneisley.com
LOCATION:Sebastopol Gallery
URL:http://sebastopolgallery.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Public Star Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T000000
UID:260514U7qi0n-b6EKtS9oROguzzw
DESCRIPTION:Public Star Parties are the heart of the Robert Ferguson Obser
 vatory—your monthly invitation to experience the wonder of the night sky
  like never before. Whether you’re a lifelong astronomy enthusiast or si
 mply curious about what lies beyond our planet\, these gatherings offer so
 mething magical for everyone.Each month includes a variety of engaging ast
 ronomy presentations led by our expert docents. You’ll hear fascinating 
 stories about the cosmos and the science behind some of the objects you’
 ll soon be observing. These talks set the stage for an unforgettable night
  under the stars.Step outside into the darkness of Sugarloaf Ridge State P
 ark\, where the skies open up in breathtaking clarity. You’ll have the c
 hance to explore the universe through three of RFO’s massive telescopes\
 , each powerful enough to reveal extraordinary detail: lunar craters\, pla
 nets\, star clusters\, glowing nebulae\, distant galaxies\, and more. In a
 ddition\, a field of smaller telescopes brought and operated by dedicated 
 volunteers\, creates a dynamic\, community-powered observing experience.Ev
 ery month offers a new selection of celestial treasures\, and our friendly
 \, knowledgeable docents are excited to guide you. They’ll help you navi
 gate the night sky\, answer questions\, and point out objects that many pe
 ople never get the chance to see.Come experience the excitement\, curiosit
 y\, and shared sense of discovery that make Public Star Parties such a che
 rished RFO tradition. Free for members—and unforgettable for everyone!
LOCATION:Robert Ferguson Observatory
URL:https://www.simpletix.com/e/public-star-parties-2026-tickets-240100
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
