 ening of live music\, local vendors\, community partners\, costumes\, danc
 ing\, good food\, drinks\, and celebration on the Mel Minton Memorial Stag
 e.\n\nBlack Sheep Brass Band | 3–5pm A super fun brass band bringing big
  energy and New Orleans-inspired sounds to kick off the celebration.\n\n80
 s Costume Contest & Fashion Show | 5:15pm Break out the neon\, denim\, seq
 uins\, leg warmers\, and big hair for our 80s costume contest and fashion 
 show! We’ll have both singles and couples categories\, with prizes for o
 ur top looks.\n\nFirst Prize: $100 Community Market Gift Card | Runner Up:
  $50 Community Market Gift Card\n\nMercy & The Heartbeats | 6–8pm Get re
 ady for a fun dance party with live music that’ll keep the energy going 
 into the evening.\n\nWe’ll also have featured vendors and community part
 ners including Goatlandia \\(with goat friends visiting\\)\, Buddy’s Far
 m\, Ethic Cider\, Goldridge Organic Farms\, Grainsong Bread\, Uproot Origi
 n\, LaLe’s Mediterranean\, and more.\n\nWe hope you’ll come celebrate 
