 OPE and Kristina Owens from the Town of Windsor as they discuss how busine
 sses can prepare for earthquakes\, wildfires\, floods\, and Public Safety 
 Power Shutoffs \\(PSPS\\). Learn practical steps to protect your employees
 \, customers\, and operations while helping our community recover faster a
 fter disasters. Each guest will receive a Sonoma County Business Emergency
  Preparedness Guide and a “GO Bag.” Businesses are the backbone of eco
 nomic recovery — preparation matters. We hope you’ll join us for this 
