 entary light appetizers in an unforgettable wine country setting. The even
 ing will also feature **music from** **DJ Armin**\, known for creating en
 ergetic\, wine country-inspired atmospheres at events throughout Sonoma Co
 unty.\n\nWe also invite you to make your way into **Club ’82**\, Kendal
