UID:260511HPUXwReKuEWy_irCKXFwQw
DESCRIPTION:American Roots party with Back pOrchEstra!- at Murphy's Sonoma
  June 18\, Thu 7:00-9:00\n\nJoin us for... some Indie and roots rock and t
 he American Roots that inspired it... with Candy Girard\, Tim Eschliman\, 
 Gary Potterton\, Jen Rund and Luis Rodriguez in a mostly-acoustic format o
 n resonator guitar\, violin\, bass\, drums\, percussion\, dobro & Telecast
 er\n\nCelebrating the new "Stories In The Heart" album\, listen now!: http
 s://orcd.co/5xga7nr\n\nSingle out now too\, "Ever Think About It:" https:/
 /orcd.co/qo5579q\n\nLPs\, CDs\, and USB-Music Cards available all over\, i
 ncluding https://www.globerecords.com\n\nVince's Hot Picks (Best of 2026):
  "... a warm\, road-worn album that leans into rich acoustic tones while f
 reely bending genres without ever breaking the feel. Built around a mostly
  unplugged framework\, the record draws from country blues\, roots rock\, 
 Zydeco\, Tex-Mex\, New Orleans rhythms\, Motown soul\, singer-songwriter t
 raditions\, and even Brazilian textures\, all woven together with an easy 
 confidence that sounds earned\, not assembled."\n\n464 1st St E\, Sonoma\,
  CA 95476 (707) 935-0660 ...with plenty of outdoor seating that includes b
 oth Murphy's Irish Pub and Taste of the Himalayas.\n\n...songs from all ov
 er the map... originals and reworked classics by Hank Williams\, Taj Mahal
 \, Dan Hicks\, Big Bill Broonzy\, Bob Wills\, Jimmy Reed\, Joseph & Cleome
  Falcon and Bobby Charles.\n\nwhat a sample? check out the "Dusty Road I'm
  On" video: https://youtu.be/jj0IIkUyrE4 ...a twangy roots rock number wit
 h a Cajun flavor and hints of Jesse Ed Davis and Sid Page....\n\n"...every
 thing from alt. rock to cajun\, to country\, to Brownie Ford era Western S
 wing. But the thing that keeps this set together is their excellent songwr
 iting full of smooth never-miss-a-beat lines and vivid imagery. It's a stu
 dio album but it sure does have a back porch jam band feel to it" - Calvin
  Powers\, WHUP-FM\, americanamusicshow.com\,\n\nmore at... https://www.Bac
 kpOrchEstra.com\n\nBandCamp: https://backporchestra.bandcamp.com\n\nyouTub
 e: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLOTwG2XEiO2O8c0dEI-7hlpI8nr7apiN
 f\n\nBluesky: https://bsky.app/profile/backporchestra.bsky.social\n\nRever
 b Nation: https://www.reverbnation.com/backporchestra\n\nFacebook: https:/
 /www.facebook.com/BackPorchEstra/\n\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/
 backporchestra/\n\n#rootsrock\n\n#americanrootsmusic\n\n#americanamusic\n\
 n#rockabillymusic\n\n#twangyguitar\n\n#backporchestra\n\n#acousticmusic\n\
 n#adultalbumalternative\n\n#singersongwriter\n\n#folkmusic\n\n#folkrock
