DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Sonoma County Pride at Hook & Ladder Winery with an 
 evening of wine\, music\, community\, and connection.\n\nJoin us among the
  vines as local DJ John Parker provides the soundtrack for a festive gathe
 ring supporting Sonoma County Pride. Enjoy fresh wood-fired pizza from our
  outdoor oven\, sip on glasses of your favorite Hook & Ladder wines\, and 
 be among the first to experience our new Chill Red release.\n\nWhether you
 ’re catching up with friends\, meeting new faces\, or simply enjoying a 
 summer evening in wine country\, all are welcome.\n\nWhat to Know\n\nFree 
 admission\n\nSuggested donation: $15\n\n20% of proceeds donated to Sonoma 
 County Pride\n\nLocal DJ John Parker\n\nFresh wood-fired pizza available\n
 \nFeaturing our new Chill Red\n\nLawn and picnic seating available \\(blan
 kets encouraged\\)\n\nFamily-friendly event\n\nWine available by the glass
  or bottle\n\nCome celebrate community\, inclusivity\, and Pride in the he
 art of Sonoma County.\n\nSip. Dance. Celebrate. Support Pride.
