DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T150000
UID:260605RdH92tXXJUe4DNovxQKg8g
DESCRIPTION:Savor the tastes of Spain with authentic paella by nationally 
 acclaimed\, locally owned Gerard's Paella\, made with locally sourced ingr
 edients and finished with our very own Gold Ridge Organic Farms Extra Virg
 in Olive Oil — all to the sounds of live Spanish guitar by Bay Area musi
 cian\, Jean-Paul.\n\nThere's plenty more to enjoy while you're here. Sampl
 e our award-winning organic olive oils and apple products\, cool off with
  an apple cider slushie or Straus ice cream drizzled with apple cider syru
 p\, and pick up something special from the Farm Shop.\n\nYou can also meet
  the makers behind family-owned Santa Rosa roaster Bella Rosa Coffee\, sm
 all-batch stone-ground salsa maker Tienda Salsita\, and Sonoma County ill
 ustrator Kate Pinto of Bean Horse Car Designs. \n\nTake a ride through o
 ur olive and apple orchards on the apple-themed decorative trolley. Tours 
 depart at 11:30AM\, 12PM\, 12:30PM\, 1PM\, 1:30PM\, and 2PM.\n\nFree entry
 . Food\, drinks and orchard tour tickets available for purchase on the day
 . Paella available from 11:30AM to 2:30PM or until sold out.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://goldridgeorganicfarms.com/blogs/events/paella-at-the-farm
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
