 ty in celebration of influential women in the community\, all in support o
 f Sonoma Valley Mentoring Alliance\, a local organization that helps yout
 h in need of social and emotional support. The evening will begin with a c
 hampagne welcome before settling into the cozy\, fireplace lounge with cav
 iar service and beautifully curated raw bar. Throughout the night\, guests
  can expect meaningful conversation and inspiring company\, including a fe
 w words from Kathy Witkowicki\, founder of Sonoma Valley Mentoring Allianc
 e\, who is a respected and influential voice in the Sonoma community.\n\nA
 s a parting gift\, each guest will receive a pair of Coyuchi pajamas\, so 
 you can take a piece of the evening home with you\, and a portion of each 
