DESCRIPTION:*Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come 
 together.*\n\n Join us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a t
 asting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from ac
 ross the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll
  and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new s
 ounds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\n**Lindsay Gang** Lindsay Gang
  is a dynamic singer-songwriter whose music blends folk\, rock\, and Amer
 icana with compelling storytelling and rich vocal expression. Known for he
 artfelt lyrics and engaging performances\, Lindsay brings energy and emoti
 onal depth to every stage\, creating moments that draw listeners into the 
 song and leave a lasting impression.\n\n**Details**\n\nNo cover. Walk-ins 
 are welcome\, but this event tends to fill up quickly\, so we recommend ma
 king a reservation. We are dog and family friendly!
