UID:2606041W7lLsim70CYvwnOY38tkA
DESCRIPTION:Join Sports Card Collectors of America at the Petaluma Fair fr
 om **June 18–21\, 2026**\, for four days of collecting\, trading\, and 
 sports memorabilia excitement! We'll be set up with a two-booth display fe
 aturing something for collectors of all ages and interests.\n\nBrowse a wi
 de selection of **sports cards\, autographs\, memorabilia\, jerseys\, sup
 plies\, vintage and modern collectibles\, singles\, sealed boxes\, Pokémo
 n cards\, One Piece cards**\, and much more. Whether you're hunting for a 
 rare grail\, building your collection\, or just getting started in the hob
 by\, you'll find plenty to explore.\n\nWe're actively looking to **buy\, 
 sell\, and trade**\, so bring your collection\, duplicates\, or items you'
 ve been thinking about selling. Our team will be available throughout the 
 fair to talk cards\, collectibles\, and the hobby we all love.\n\n📅 **
 June 18–21\, 2026** 🕚 **Petaluma Fair Hours: 11:00 AM – 11:00 PM D
 aily** 📍 **Petaluma Fairgrounds** 175 Fairgrounds Drive Petaluma\, CA\
 n\nFeaturing:\n\nSports Cards\n\nAutographs\n\nMemorabilia\n\nJerseys\n\nP
 okémon Cards\n\nOne Piece Cards\n\nVintage & Modern Collectibles\n\nSingl
 es & Sealed Products\n\nHobby Supplies\n\nBuy • Sell • Trade\n\nStop b
 y our booth\, meet fellow collectors\, discover new treasures\, and celebr
 ate the hobby with us. We look forward to seeing you at the Petaluma Fair!
 \n\n📸 Instagram: @sportscardcollectorsofamerica
LOCATION:Petaluma Fairgrounds
URL:https://www.sportscardscoa.com/event/sports-cards-memorabilia-show-0
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
