 is will be a fun\, kid friendly event with local mushroom art\, hands on a
 ctivities and workshops\, food and more! Our keynote presenter\, Wilder He
 rbertson will be talking about mushroom dyes and where to find the mushroo
 ms you get color from. Hope to see you there!\n\nWhen: Sunday\, Jun 21st 1
 0-4pm\n\nWhere: Sebastopol Grange Hall\n\n6000 Sebastopol Ave\, Sebastopol
 \, CA 95472
