BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queer Awareness in Uncertain Times: Cultivating a Spiritual Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260621T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260621T130000
UID:260519G26pCAGG6Uu0Hc3dCWr3AQ
DESCRIPTION:with Carol Cano\, Kimber Simpkins-Nuccio and Rebekah Eppley\n\
 nThis gathering invites LGBTQ\\+ community and allies into shared space of
  presence\, care\, and belonging.\n\nIn times of uncertainty\, queer aware
 ness becomes a sacred orientation that is fluid\, intuitive\, and embodied
  in truth. It honors the fullness of lived experience while opening pathwa
 ys toward resilience and collective liberation. Together\, we cultivate a 
 spiritual center grounded in mindfulness\, compassion\, and relational pra
 ctice.\n\nThrough meditation\, reflection\, and community connection\, we 
 gently steady the heart and soften the body. We listen deeply to ourselves
 \, to one another\, and to the living nature reflects and holds us. Throug
 hout this half-day\, we’ll remember belonging as a living experience tha
 t is held by connection\, sustained through community\, and expressed thro
 ugh love\, dignity\, and shared liberation.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/queer-awareness-in-unc
 ertain-times-cultivating-a-spiritual-center-cc2h26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
