DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Father’s Day with brunch set in our stunning fount
 ain courtyard. Surrounded by historic charm and relaxed elegance\, this sp
 ecial gathering is designed to make him feel truly appreciated and to crea
 te meaningful moments with family and friends.\n\nGuests will enjoy a dele
 ctable buffet-style brunch menu thoughtfully prepared by local favorite\, 
 HopMonk. Featuring an array of flavorful seasonal offerings\, the experien
 ce pairs delicious cuisine with the timeless beauty and character of Buena
  Vista for a celebration worthy of the occasion.\n\nOur Father's Day Brunc
 h Includes: Farm Egg Casserole House Smoked Sausage Cheeseburger Sliders C
 rushed Potatoes Assorted Pastries Citrus Salad Green Salad w/ Arugula and 
 Citrus Vinaigrette Coffee/Tea
