DESCRIPTION:Kelseyville's 8th Annual Lake County Beer\, Wine & Swine Bacon
 fest IT’S BACK AND BACON-IER THAN EVER!  Kelseyville Business Associatio
 n’s 8th Annual Lake County Beer\, Wine & Swine BACONFEST ️ Father’s 
 Day — Sunday\, June 21\, 2025  11:00am-4:00pm Downtown Kelseyville Get r
 eady to pig out on Lake County’s tastiest tradition! The Baconfest is re
 turning this Father’s Day with more sizzle\, more flavor\, and more baco
 n-packed bites than ever before. Whether you’re a foodie\, a craft bever
 age connoisseur\, or just here for the good vibes\, this is a festival you
  don’t want to miss! Our amazing chefs\, cooks\, and culinary rebels wil
 l throw down in a pork-powered battle for the title of 2026 Bacon Master 
 — plus $1\,000 in crispy cash! Prizes: 1st Place – $1\,000 2nd Place 
 – $500 3rd Place – $250 Enjoy ice-cold craft beer & local wines\,  gro
 ove to live music\, and cast your vote for the People’s Choice Bacon Dis
 h \\($250 for People's Choice winner!\\). This sizzling street fest is the
  ultimate way to celebrate Dad\, indulge your inner bacon lover\, and supp
 ort our amazing local businesses. ️ Mark your calendars\, gather your cr
 ew\, and come hungry! Father’s Day never tasted this good. Tickets go on
  sale May 1st online.  Limited tickets will be sold on day of event.  Tick
 et sales end at 2pm day of event.  Availability of food past this point ca
 n not be guaranteed
