DESCRIPTION:AI becomes valuable when it helps with real work. The Napa Cha
 mber's AI Mastery Workshop Series for Project Managers and Professionals i
 s designed for people who want to use AI more effectively in communication
 \, research\, planning\, documentation\, and recurring day-to-day tasks. T
 his includes project managers\, operations staff\, office managers\, coord
 inators\, marketers\, administrators\, and other professionals who want to
  understand how AI can support their work in practical ways. This is not a
  technical class and it is not just another tool tutorial. It is an in-per
 son\, small-group workshop series built to help local professionals learn 
 how to use AI more effectively in the work they already do. What you will 
 learn and walk away with: A better understanding of how to use AI for ever
 yday work such as emails\, summaries\, planning\, research\, and documenta
 tion Stronger prompting skills so you can get more accurate and useful out
 put A clearer way to give AI the context it needs so results sound more in
 formed and relevant A practical framework for using internal documents\, S
 OPs\, and examples to improve AI performance A reusable starter library of
  prompts for your role Better judgment about when AI is helpful\, when it 
 is not\, and how to review output effectively A working AI-supported workf
 low or helper you can continue using after the workshop Who should attend 
 Project managers Operations managers Coordinators Administrative professio
 nals Marketing and communications staff Office managers Team members who w
 ant to use AI in daily workflows
URL:https://business.napachamber.com/events/details/ai-mastery-program-for
