 ng yourself.\n\n**What you'll learn:**\n\n💜 How to transfer or sketch a
  reference picture onto your canvas.\n\n💜 How to mix\, blend\, and buil
 d layers with acrylic paint.\n\n💜 Most importantly\, practice letting g
 o! Learning how to play\, explore\, and have fun making art!\n\nJune 04 - 
 Elephants\n\nJune 11 - Dogs\n\nJune 18 - Sheep\n\nJune 25 - Tigers\n\nThur
 sdays\, 1-3 PM\, $45 per class.\n\n**Bring a friend & both get $10 off!**
