BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jocelyn Simone & Sebastiani Theatre presents Thunderpussy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T190000
UID:260514RzDzqdFHC0W_TWwQSBiGzw
DESCRIPTION:Jocelyn Simone & Sebastiani Theatre presents Thunderpussy Frid
 ay\, June 26\, 2026 Doors 7:00PM Show 8:00PM Hailing from Seattle\, Thunde
 rpussy is an all-female rock 'n' roll powerhouse and they don't just bring
  the thunder\, they are the storm. Since 2014\, Molly Sides\, Whitney Pett
 y\, Leah Julius\, and Michelle Nuño have built a reputation for sweat-dre
 nched\, high-voltage shows that hit fast\, loud\, and a little dangerous. 
  Channeling the spirit of Led Zeppelin and Heart\, they serve up blisterin
 g riffs\, feral vocals\, and the kind of raw musical chemistry that leaves
  you breathless. Their name might raise eyebrows. Their music raises hell.
  In a genre that hasn't always made room for women\, Thunderpussy takes up
  space in heels\, leather\, and zero apologies\, equal parts raw power and
  playful defiance. They are the lipstick on the microphone\, the riff that
  splits your chest wide open\, the first note that makes every single pers
 on in the room throw their head back and scream yes! Because this\, right 
 here\, is exactly what rock 'n' roll was always supposed to feel like. Eup
 horia! $20 ADV | $30 DOORS TICKETS ON SALE NOW events.sebastianitheatre.co
 m
LOCATION:Sebastiani Theatre
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/982145311421889/?acontext=%7B%22event_
 action_history%22%3A[%7B%22mechanism%22%3A%22lov_feed%22%2C%22surface%22%3
 A%22bookmark%22%7D]%2C%22ref_notif_type%22%3Anull%7D
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
