UID:2606063801imclLEOqt0bBhp_lcw
DESCRIPTION:H&L Live: Dan Martin & the Noma Rocksteady Band\n\nSpend a sum
 mer afternoon among the vines with the infectious sounds of Dan Martin & t
 he Noma Rocksteady Band. Hailing from Sonoma\, these North Bay favorites b
 ring old-school Rocksteady\, Reggae\, and Ska inspired by the classic Jama
 ican sounds of the 1960s and early '70s. Voted Best Reggae Band in the Nor
 th Bay by readers of the North Bay Bohemian\, Dan Martin and his 7-piece b
 and are guaranteed to move your feet and lift your spirits.\n\nThis is wha
 t our stage was built for: great artists\, beautiful afternoons\, and the 
 Russian River Valley as your backdrop. Bring a blanket\, grab a glass\, an
 d settle in for one of those perfect wine country moments.\n\nWhat to Know
 :\n\nAdmission is free - just show up and enjoy\n\nPizza & Chill Red: Fres
 h wood-fired pizza paired with our new Chill Red\n\nOutdoor seating - Lawn
  and picnic area available \\(bring blankets encouraged\\)\n\nAll ages wel
 come - Family-friendly event\n\nWine available for purchase by the glass o
 r bottle\n\nCome for the music\, stay for the pizza\, and remember why Sat
 urdays in Sonoma County are the best.\n\nLearn more about the band: nomaro
 cksteady.com\n\n‍\n\n‍
LOCATION:Hook & Ladder Winery
URL:https://www.hookandladderwinery.com/event/hl-live-dan-martin-noma-rock
 steady-band
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
