DESCRIPTION:Based on the award-winning Broadway musical and the smash hit 
 motion picture\, Legally Blonde The Musical JR. is a fabulously fun journe
 y of self-empowerment and expanding horizons. The show's instantly recogni
 zable songs are filled with humor\, wit and sass — leaving  audiences se
 eing pink! Legally Blonde JR. follows the transformation of Elle Woods as 
 she tackles stereotypes\, snobbery and scandal in pursuit of her dreams. W
 hen Elle's boyfriend\, Warner\, dumps her and heads to Harvard\, claiming 
 she's not "serious" enough\, Elle takes matters into her own hands\, craft
 ing a showy song-and-dance personal essay and charming her way into law sc
 hool. Befriending classmate\, Emmett\, and spunky hairdresser\, Paulette\,
  along the way\, Elle finds that books and looks aren't mutually exclusive
 .  As Elle begins outsmarting her peers\, she realizes that law may be her
  natural calling after all. Door open: 2:00pm TICKETS ZONE A \\(Close to t
 he action\\) $30 ZONE B \\(Middle of the house\\) $25 ZONE C \\(In the bac
 k\\) $20 Tickets at Door - $30 - ZONE C only. So buy in advance
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1715758739451057/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
